# leviroutes-f9n: a committed .npmrc can disarm the whole publish gate (ignore-scripts=true
# skips prepublishOnly, so no test or verify-package step runs and nothing says so). The
# publish gate refuses such a file, but only when it runs - so keep the file out of git.
